  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><h3 style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong>About Our Brand &amp; Products</strong></h3><p style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">Good Quality Human is a premium lifestyle apparel brand founded in Los Angeles with a mission to spread kindness through thoughtfully designed clothing and accessories. Our collections feature elevated hats, hoodies, crewnecks, tees, totes, and accessories crafted with premium materials, unique details, and timeless style. Every product is <strong>Made for Kindness®</strong> and designed to inspire meaningful conversations and everyday connection.</p><h3 style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong>What Makes Us Different</strong></h3><p style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">We’re more than an apparel brand—we’re building a movement centered around kindness, community, and positivity. We don’t chase trends or rely on heavy discounting. Instead, we create limited-edition collections, exceptional quality products, and an authentic brand that people are proud to wear and share.</p><h3 style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong>How Affiliates Can Earn</strong></h3><p style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">Affiliates earn <strong>10% commission</strong> on every qualified sale generated through their unique referral link or discount code. Commissions are approved after our 30-day return period and are paid monthly. Top-performing ambassadors may receive exclusive product launches, gifted merchandise, increased commission opportunities, and special collaborations.</p><h3 style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong>How to Promote Us</strong></h3><p style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">Share your authentic experience wearing Good Quality Human through Instagram, TikTok, YouTube, Pinterest, blogs, email newsletters, or other social platforms. Lifestyle photos, outfit inspiration, unboxings, styling videos, and genuine storytelling perform best with our community.</p><h3 style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong>Other Information</strong></h3><p style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">We love partnering with creators who genuinely align with our mission of spreading kindness. Whether you have a small, engaged community or a large audience, we value authenticity over follower count. If you believe kindness never goes out of style, we’d love to have you represent Good Quality Human.</p></div>",
