  "term_and_condition": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align:center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:30pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:0.6em;vertical-align:super;\">GOOD QUALITY HUMAN </span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align:center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:18pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">AMBASSADOR AGREEMENT </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-right:28.300079345703125pt;text-indent:-0.5400009155273438pt;margin-top:23.3900146484375pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0.5400009155273438pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">This Ambassador Agreement (\"Agreement\") is entered into between </span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Good Quality Human </span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">(\"Company\") and the approved individual (\"Ambassador\"). By participating in the Ambassador Program, Ambassador agrees to the following terms and conditions. </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-left:1.0719985961914062pt;margin-top:31.13397216796875pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">1. Program Scope </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-right:4.7000732421875pt;margin-top:5.9959716796875pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Ambassador Program is designed to reward authentic, organic promotion of Good Quality Human through personal social media platforms, word-of-mouth referrals, and community engagement. </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-left:0.1719970703125pt;margin-top:31.13397216796875pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">2. Permitted Promotion </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-right:6.9500732421875pt;text-indent:-0.26000213623046875pt;margin-top:5.996002197265625pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0.26000213623046875pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Ambassadors may promote Good Quality Human through organic social media posts, stories, reels, email marketing to personal lists, and in-person recommendations. All representations must align with Good Quality Human’s brand values and messaging. </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-left:0.26799774169921875pt;margin-top:31.134002685546875pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">3. Prohibited Activities </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-right:6.39007568359375pt;text-indent:-0.220001220703125pt;margin-top:5.996002197265625pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0.220001220703125pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">To protect the integrity of the Good Quality Human brand and ensure fair attribution, ambassadors and affiliates may not engage in the following activities without prior written approval: - Running paid advertisements (Google Ads, Meta Ads, YouTube Ads, TikTok Ads, etc.) - Bidding on Good Quality Human brand keywords or close variations - Using discount, coupon, or promo websites - Retargeting existing customers or brand traffic - Misrepresenting affiliation or acting as an employee of the Company </span></p><p style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">Further details of prohibited behaviors:</p><ul style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><li style=\"margin-left:15px;\"><p>Run Google Ads, Bing Ads, YouTube Ads, Meta Ads, or any paid media driving traffic directly to <a href=\"http://goodqualityhuman.com/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204);\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">goodqualityhuman.com</a></p></li><li style=\"margin-left:15px;\"><p>Bid on Good Quality Human, GoodQualityHuman, GQH, or any misspellings or branded keyword variations</p></li><li style=\"margin-left:15px;\"><p>Use Good Quality Human brand terms in ad copy, display URLs, or keyword targeting</p></li><li style=\"margin-left:15px;\"><p>Retarget existing customers or create lookalike audiences using Good Quality Human traffic or data</p></li></ul><p style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"> Allowed:</p><ul style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><li style=\"margin-left:15px;\"><p>Organic social media posts</p></li><li style=\"margin-left:15px;\"><p>Email marketing to personal lists</p></li><li style=\"margin-left:15px;\"><p>Content creation (UGC, lifestyle posts, stories, reels, etc.)</p></li></ul><p style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"> Not Allowed Without Written Approval:</p><ul style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><li style=\"margin-left:15px;\"><p>Any paid search or paid social advertising</p></li></ul><p style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">Violation of this policy may result in:</p><ul style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><li style=\"margin-left:15px;\"><p>Immediate deactivation from the program</p></li><li style=\"margin-left:15px;\"><p>Forfeiture of unpaid commissions</p></li><li style=\"margin-left:15px;\"><p>Removal from future ambassador opportunities</p></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-right:6.39007568359375pt;text-indent:-0.220001220703125pt;margin-top:5.996002197265625pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0.220001220703125pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-right:6.39007568359375pt;text-indent:-0.220001220703125pt;margin-top:5.996002197265625pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0.220001220703125pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">4. Commission &amp; Attribution </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-left:0.3000030517578125pt;margin-right:6.93011474609375pt;text-indent:-0.20999908447265625pt;margin-top:5.996002197265625pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0.20999908447265625pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Commission is earned only on legitimate, incremental sales generated through approved promotion methods. Sales resulting from paid search, branded traffic, repeat customers, or direct brand inquiries may be disqualified at the Company’s discretion. </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-left:0.2440032958984375pt;margin-top:31.134002685546875pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">5. Brand Usage </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-right:4.13006591796875pt;text-indent:-0.220001220703125pt;margin-top:5.996002197265625pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0.220001220703125pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Ambassador is granted a non-exclusive, revocable license to use Good Quality Human trademarks, logos, and assets solely for approved promotional purposes. All brand assets must be used accurately and respectfully. </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-left:0.31600189208984375pt;margin-top:31.134002685546875pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">6. Termination </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-right:18.0400390625pt;text-indent:0.34000396728515625pt;margin-top:5.996002197265625pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Good Quality Human reserves the right to suspend or terminate this Agreement at any time, with or without cause, including for policy violations or conduct deemed harmful to the brand.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-left:0.3040008544921875pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-left:0.3040008544921875pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-left:0.3040008544921875pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">7. Confidentiality </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-right:19.69000244140625pt;text-indent:-0.44000244140625pt;margin-top:5.9959716796875pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0.44000244140625pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Ambassador agrees not to disclose confidential information including sales data, strategies, launch plans, or internal communications. </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-left:0.31600189208984375pt;margin-top:31.13397216796875pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">8. Independent Contractor </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-right:22.990081787109375pt;text-indent:-0.6299972534179688pt;margin-top:5.9959716796875pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0.6299972534179688pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Ambassador is an independent contractor and not an employee, partner, or agent of Good Quality Human. </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-left:0.3639984130859375pt;margin-top:31.13397216796875pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">9. Governing Law </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-right:34.120025634765625pt;text-indent:-0.3000030517578125pt;margin-top:5.9959716796875pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0.3000030517578125pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">This Agreement shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the State of California. </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-left:1.0719985961914062pt;margin-top:31.134002685546875pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">10. Acceptance </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;text-indent:0.5999984741210938pt;margin-top:5.996002197265625pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">By participating in the Ambassador Program, Ambassador acknowledges and agrees to all terms of this Agreement. </span></p><p style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><br></p></div>",
